OL,3,GNEWSABlue Planet III ventures into
OL,4,Adarkest depths of ocean
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir David Attenborough has promised to
OL,7,F"venture even further" and uncover
OL,8,Fmarine life that is "more precious than
OL,9,Fwe ever realised" in Blue Planet III.
OL,11,FThe broadcaster, who turned 100 earlier
OL,12,Fthis year, narrates the new six-part
OL,13,Fseries exploring the darkest depths of
OL,14,Fthe world's oceans, produced by the BBC
OL,15,FNatural History Unit in Bristol.
OL,17,FAfter almost four years of filming, the
OL,18,Flatest instalment in the franchise will
OL,19,Fair on the BBC later this autumn,
OL,20,Fmarking 25 years since the first series
OL,21,Fpremiered.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
