OL,3,GNEWSABlue Planet III ventures into
OL,4,Adarkest depths of ocean
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a launch event on Tuesday, Sir David
OL,7,Fsaid: "When I narrated the first Blue
OL,8,FPlanet series, it didn't occur to me
OL,9,Fthat I would be narrating a third
OL,10,Fseries in my centennial year."
